258,"en":"You killed all my wrestlers."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b002:l001","ordinal":355259,"en":"Reducing me to a smokeless ember,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b002:l002","ordinal":355260,"en":"You have set my soul ablaze,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b002:l003","ordinal":355261,"en":"You have drained away my strength."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b002:l004","ordinal":355262,"en":"You carried off as plunder"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b002:l005","ordinal":355263,"en":"So many of my swift steeds;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b002:l006","ordinal":355264,"en":"You ignored my pleading words"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b002:l007","ordinal":355265,"en":"And struck down, before my eyes,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b002:l008","ordinal":355266,"en":"My people as well."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b002:l009","ordinal":355267,"en":"You brazen bitch, you have chilled"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b002:l010","ordinal":355268,"en":"The proud strength in my back."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b002:l011","ordinal":355269,"en":"Over narrow cliffs and rugged, arduous roads,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b002:l012","ordinal":355270,"en":"I have come to exact vengeance."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b002:l013","ordinal":355271,"en":"Bringing hardship, affliction, and strife,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b002:l014","ordinal":355272,"en":"Fighting tirelessly for six months,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b002:l015","ordinal":355273,"en":"You renowned woman, warrior maiden,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b002:l016","ordinal":355274,"en":"I have come to take revenge on you!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b002:l017","ordinal":355275,"en":"If you accept a fair settlement, bitch,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b002:l018","ordinal":355276,"en":"I have come to divide"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b002:l019","ordinal":355277,"en":"The treasure of Kayypchal."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b002:l020","ordinal":355278,"en":"But if you bristle in fury,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b002:l021","ordinal":355279,"en":"I have come to fight day and night without fleeing,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b002:l022","ordinal":355280,"en":"Until one of us dies."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b002:l023","ordinal":355281,"en":"If you do not accept these words,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b002:l024","ordinal":355282,"en":"If you do not pay the blood-price,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b002:l025","ordinal":355283,"en":"I shall not let you sow your crops,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b002:l026","ordinal":355284,"en":"Break open the earth,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b002:l027","ordinal":355285,"en":"Or carry on your livelihood."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b002:l028","ordinal":355286,"en":"I bristle with fury;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b002:l029","ordinal":355287,"en":"You have sorely provoked my rage."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b002:l030","ordinal":355288,"en":"My very being thirsts for blood."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b002:l031","ordinal":355289,"en":"I shall die before suffering disgrace—"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b002:l032","ordinal":355290,"en":"Mark well the words I speak,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b002:l033","ordinal":355291,"en":"And do not rouse my savage wrath;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b002:l034","ordinal":355292,"en":"Come against me, raging bitch!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b002:l035","ordinal":355293,"en":"Let it be said that mighty Kuyaly"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b002:l036","ordinal":355294,"en":"Was taken by warrior Sarybay;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b002:l037","ordinal":355295,"en":"Let the dread banner of dominion be raised,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b002:l038","ordinal":355296,"en":"Let there be an uproar that rends the sky."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b002:l039","ordinal":355297,"en":"Let it win fame among every nation"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b002:l040","ordinal":355298,"en":"And be a lesson to those who remain."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b004:l001","ordinal":355299,"en":"Red-robed maidens with moon-slender waists,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b004:l002","ordinal":355300,"en":"Let your beautiful leader of girls come forth;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b004:l003","ordinal":355301,"en":"Let your nimble young men come forth."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b004:l004","ordinal":355302,"en":"I shall take you all as plunder,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b004:l005","ordinal":355303,"en":"I shall slaughter every one of you!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b004:l006","ordinal":355304,"en":"My name is Sarybay,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b004:l007","ordinal":355305,"en":"And now my fierce rage is roused."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b004:l008","ordinal":355306,"en":"When wrath takes me, I stand unyielding;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b004:l009","ordinal":355307,"en":"I roar with menace,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b004:l010","ordinal":355308,"en":"And today I have summoned"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b004:l011","ordinal":355309,"en":"The turmoil of the whole world."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b004:l012","ordinal":355310,"en":"My true fury has seized me;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b004:l013","ordinal":355311,"en":"If I do not utterly destroy your people,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b004:l014","ordinal":355312,"en":"If I do not make girls like you"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b004:l015","ordinal":355313,"en":"My women upon the open steppe,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b004:l016","ordinal":355314,"en":"May I die unworthy of the name Sarybay,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b004:l017","ordinal":355315,"en":"May I sink into darkness as though never born!”"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b004:l018","ordinal":355316,"en":"Thus Sarybay spoke,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b004:l019","ordinal":355317,"en":"And when he made that threat,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b004:l020","ordinal":355318,"en":"Her thoughts pierced and scattered,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b004:l021","ordinal":355319,"en":"A thousand grievous troubles"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b004:l022","ordinal":355320,"en":"Pressed close upon her soul."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b004:l023","ordinal":355321,"en":"“I stand upright and free;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b004:l024","ordinal":355322,"en":"Driven by honor, wretched soul that I am,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b004:l025","ordinal":355323,"en":"I shall strike this wrathful infidel,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b004:l026","ordinal":355324,"en":"Who has inflicted such abundant sorrow;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b004:l027","ordinal":355325,"en":"I shall crush beneath my feet"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b004:l028","ordinal":355326,"en":"Those other wretched wretches."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b004:l029","ordinal":355327,"en":"I shall utterly annihilate them"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0769:b004:l030","ordinal":355328,"en":"And slaughter their champions."}]
